1	line	Player	Hey, Skippy!
1	line	Skippy	Gaah! Don't drench me again!
1	line	Player	Hey! I only did that once! Try not to be such a big baby!
1	line	Skippy	So what are you here for then?
1	line	Player	I've come to give you your tea.
1	line	Skippy	Excellent! I was thinking I was going to freeze out here!
1	box	Skippy drinks the tea and clutches his forehead in pain.
1	line	Skippy	Ohhhhh...
1	line	Player	What? What's wrong?
1	line	Skippy	Not so loud...I think I have a hangover...
1	line	Player	Great...Well, I doubt you can remember anything through a hangover. What a waste of nettle tea...
1	line	Skippy	Hey! A little sympathy here?
1	line	Skippy	Owwowwoww... must remember not to shout...
1	line	Skippy	Look, I do know a hangover cure. If you can get me a bucket of the stuff I think I'll be ok.
1	action	If the player has learned the hangover cure recipe during Plague City:
