2	line	Skippy	Yes! That's the stuff!
2	line	Player	Ahhh. Yes, I've made some of that stuff before. I should be able to get you some, no problem.
2	action	end
1	action	If the player has not learned the hangover cure recipe:
2	line	Player	So what is it you need?
2	line	Skippy	A bucket of milk with chocolate ground into it, with a handful of snape grass thrown in on top.
2	line	Player	What? Run that past me again?
2	line	Skippy	Take a bucket of milk, a bar of chocolate and some snape grass.
2	line	Skippy	Grind the chocolate with a mortar and pestle.
2	line	Skippy	Add the chocolate powder to the milk, then add the snape grass.
2	line	Skippy	Then bring it here and I will drink it.
2	line	Skippy	The end, and we all live happily ever after. Got it?
2	action	end
0	section	Talking to him before obtaining hangover cure
