0	section	Bringing him the hangover cure
1	line	Player	Hey, Skippy!
1	line	Skippy	Egad! Don't you know not to shout around a guy with a hangover?
1	line	Skippy	Ahhhhhg...No more shouting for me...
1	line	Skippy	What is it anyway?
1	line	Player	Well Skippy, you will no doubt be glad to hear that I got you your hangover cure!
1	line	Skippy	Gimme!
1	box	Skippy chugs the hangover cure... very impressive.
1	line	Skippy	Ahhhhhhhhhhhhhhh...
1	line	Skippy	Much better...
1	line	Player	Feeling better?
1	line	Skippy	Considerably.
1	line	Player	Then tell me where the mudskippers are!
1	line	Skippy	I wish you wouldn't go looking for them. Those vicious killers will tear you apart.
1	line	Skippy	It's all becoming clear to me now...
1	line	Skippy	I was fishing using a Fishing Explosive...
1	line	Player	A Fishing Explosive?
1	line	Skippy	Well, Slayer Masters sell these highly volatile potions for killing underwater creatures.
1	line	Skippy	If you don't feel like lobbing a net about all day you can use them to fish with...
1	line	Skippy	But this time I was startled by what I thought was a giant mudskipper.
1	line	Skippy	What it was, infact, was a...
1	line	Skippy	Dramatic Pause...
1	line	Skippy	A Mogre!
1	line	Player	What exactly is a Mogre?
1	line	Skippy	A Mogre is a type of Ogre that spends most of its time underwater.
1	line	Skippy	They hunt giant mudskippers by wearing their skins and swimming close until they can attack them.
1	line	Skippy	When I used the Fishing Explosive I scared off all the fish, and so the Mogre got out of the water to express its extreme displeasure.
1	line	Skippy	With an iron mace.
1	line	Player	I take it the head injury is responsible for the staggering and yelling?
1	line	Skippy	No, no.
1	line	Skippy	My addiction to almost-lethal alcohol did that.
1	line	Skippy	But if you are set on finding these Mogres just head south from here until you find Mudskipper Point.
1	line	Player	The mudskipper-eating monsters are to be found at Mudskipper point?
1	line	Player	Shock!
1	line	Player	Thanks. I'll be careful.
1	action	end
